# Drizzle
# NOTE: apps/api/drizzle/meta is deliberately NOT ignored. It is the migration
# journal — drizzle-kit refuses to apply migrations whose meta is missing from
# the repo, and without it `bun run db:migrate` only works on the machine that
# generated the SQL.

